{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110506001:1":{"text":"너희도 아까 그 관문을 통과했나 보군.","source_cn":"看来，你们也通过了刚才那一关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FDAB3B86055B479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110506002:1":{"text":"또 만났네요, 세스 님! 역시 “지식의 시련”의 승자를 가리기 쉽지 않죠?!","source_cn":"又见面了，赛特斯大人！看来“智之试炼”的胜者还没那么容...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7357692B96D36E29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110506003:1":{"text":"웃기는군. 이게 속도전이었다면 너희는 벌써 집에 갔어야 해.","source_cn":"可笑。如果这是竞速淘汰，你们早已输了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14DB4CA3F5C81D12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110506004:1":{"text":"오합지졸이라 그런지 나 혼자 도전하는 것보다도 속도가 느리군. 너희가 자랑하는 <style=\"highlight\">협력</style>이란 게 겨우 이 정도밖에 안 되는 거였어?","source_cn":"一群乌合之众，过关的速度竟还不如我一个人。你们引以为傲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82F15A29D8A89713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110506005:1":{"text":"속도가 조금 빠른 게 뭐 그리 대단한 거라고.","source_cn":"腿脚快些，也说明不了什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85F5FCB39750A7F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110506006:1":{"text":"흥. 고집부리기는. 그 대단한 고집만큼 주먹도 당연히 세겠지?","source_cn":"呵，嘴硬。希望你的拳头比嘴更硬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE5ACD0E16B1D3F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110506007:1":{"text":"얼른 이동해. 그리고 다시는 나와 붙지 않게 해달라고 석양의 신한테 기도하는 게 좋을 거야.","source_cn":"继续前进吧。你们应当向残阳神祷告，下一关不必与我白刃相向！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1139CFF4EC2FF501","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:赛特斯":{"text":"세스","source":"赛特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}